    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tummy Bonbons The Sweet Monster is a Gameboy-inspired survival game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tummy\u00a0is hungry. They need candy to survive. Luckily, on this beautiful Halloween night, there are tons of children to frighten, with pockets full of precious sweets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat candy. Get spookier. Scare children. Choose new bellies based on their upgrades. Eat more candy! Eat as much as you can!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't bite off more than you can chew! Brave kids and crows will hurt you and steal your sweets. You might well end up starving...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plays with a keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 3 difficulty modes plus an endless mode, a local leaderboard and color palettes to unlock.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tummy Bonbons The Sweet Monster is a Gameboy-inspired survival game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tummy\u00a0is hungry. They need candy to survive. Luckily, on this beautiful Halloween night, there are tons of children to frighten, with pockets full of precious sweets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat candy. Get spookier. Scare children. Choose new bellies based on their upgrades. Eat more candy! Eat as much as you can!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't bite off more than you can chew! Brave kids and crows will hurt you and steal your sweets. You might well end up starving...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plays with a keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 3 difficulty modes plus an endless mode, a local leaderboard and color palettes to unlock.</p>",
    "short_description": "It is Halloween and Tummy the monster is hungry. Time to scare children and steal their candy!",
